    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > You can enjoy it repeatedly with multiplayer and score ranking support!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can enjoy a quick 10 to 20-minute play session and replay as many times as you like!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Of course, you can enjoy this game even if you\u2019re not familiar with the original game it\u2019s based on.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game rules are simple and easy to understand!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Let\u2019s connect the 'YOU' pieces to aim for a bigger 'YOU'!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If the 'YOU' pieces spill out of the box, it's game over.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >To get a high score, connect 'YOU' pieces of the same size efficiently.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >The game modes are 'One Player' and 'Two Players'!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >'One Player', lets you enjoy a solo score attack.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >'Two Players', players take turns dropping 'YOU'.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Support for score rankings has been added for each game mode.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Compete in the score rankings for both 'One Player' and 'Two Players'!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Compete with '<i>YOU Game</i>' players from all over the world for your score!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > Please enjoy the enhanced '<i>YOU Game+</i>'!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>This game is an extended version of the mini-game included in 'KUUKIYOMI 4: Consider It'.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Please ensure you understand this before making your purchase.</i></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > You can enjoy it repeatedly with multiplayer and score ranking support!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can enjoy a quick 10 to 20-minute play session and replay as many times as you like!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Of course, you can enjoy this game even if you\u2019re not familiar with the original game it\u2019s based on.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game rules are simple and easy to understand!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Let\u2019s connect the 'YOU' pieces to aim for a bigger 'YOU'!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If the 'YOU' pieces spill out of the box, it's game over.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >To get a high score, connect 'YOU' pieces of the same size efficiently.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >The game modes are 'One Player' and 'Two Players'!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >'One Player', lets you enjoy a solo score attack.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >'Two Players', players take turns dropping 'YOU'.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Support for score rankings has been added for each game mode.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Compete in the score rankings for both 'One Player' and 'Two Players'!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Compete with '<i>YOU Game</i>' players from all over the world for your score!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > Please enjoy the enhanced '<i>YOU Game+</i>'!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>This game is an extended version of the mini-game included in 'KUUKIYOMI 4: Consider It'.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Please ensure you understand this before making your purchase.</i></p>",
